            <h1 className="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-white tracking-tight leading-tight">
              Travel Anywhere for <span className="bg-clip-text text-transparent bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-400 via-teal-300 to-cyan-400">Negligible Prices</span>
